        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, electric bicycle</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, electric bicycle
The data set reflects the replacement of parts for the maintenance of an e-bike of 24kg  with a LiIo battery. Battery replacemnet: 2.75 times. Life expectancy battery: 4'000 km.;
UUID: 6ee7bda3-dd14-3c58-8d14-5108a822b721
This data sets includes the maintenance of an electric bicycle throughout its life cycle.
Location: Data cover maintenance in Switzerland
Technology: Maintenance of an electric bicycle
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6ee7bda3-dd14-3c58-8d14-5108a822b721.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
